0 // 2026-10-16 SOURCE DEPARTURE: five geared 6523 shafts replaced by real grey 6522 6L at original centers.
0 // Source P6 crank 6526 restored. Upper beam/poster raised 40 LDU from original and upper pulley 51 LDU, including the added 24-LDU foundation plates.
0 // Support chain lower pulley -> crank -> upper beam -> upper pulley independently checked; eccentric pin engages X80 beam hole for full 40 LDU.
0 // Top caps and central bridging brick have actual stud support. No human acceptance; sampled drive review documented below.
0 // Two real 40666 support plates added beneath central beam; four adjoining blue caps raised 24 LDU onto that beam.
0 // Crown moved to Z-60 and driven red gear to Y-36 for real engagement; road wheels and shafts keyed together at 4.5 degrees.
0 // Source 56 placements plus two support plates = 58. All shaft hubs and structural support independently checked.
0 // Input 0..1800 degrees in 5-degree samples: 361 linked poses, no unresolved intersections; correct crown direction also tested against a colliding wrong-direction control.

